  "annotations": [
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Kept a 7-card hand with 3 Swamps and no blue mana sources, despite 3 of 4 spells requiring blue mana (Artificer's Epiphany, Launch Mishap, Whirler Rogue). Only Phyrexian Broodlings is castable. The hand is effectively a 1-spell hand until Islands are drawn.",
