      "decision_index": 2,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Playing Buried Ruin over Island. Both lands enter untapped and enable casting Juggernaut this turn, but Island provides blue mana for future blue spells (the hand likely contains or will draw blue cards given the deck's blue component), while Buried Ruin only produces colorless and has a marginal sacrifice ability with no artifacts in the graveyard yet.",
      "action_taken": "Played Buried Ruin as their land for the turn",
