      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 55,
      "player": "MstLg Rivals",
      "decision_index": 22,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Chose White for Thriving Isle when there are no white cards in hand or apparent in the deck. The deck is clearly UB (blue-black), and choosing Black would allow Thriving Isle to produce either U or B, providing crucial flexibility for casting Entomber Exarch (2BB) alongside blue spells like Whirler Rogue and Launch Mishap.",
      "action_taken": "Chose White as the second color for Thriving Isle",
      "better_line": "Choose Black for Thriving Isle, allowing it to tap for U or B to support the UB mana base and help cast Entomber Exarch with its BB requirement.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 62,
      "player": "GptOSS Gramps",
      "decision_index": 24,
    },
    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Opponent is sacrificing their Phyrexian Myr token to grow Phyrexian Broodlings. Bouncing Broodlings in response with Aether Spellbomb would create a virtual 2-for-1: the token is already sacrificed as a cost, and the Broodlings returns to hand without getting the counter. The opponent has all lands tapped and can't replay it this turn.",
      "action_taken": "Passed priority, letting the +1/+1 counter resolve on Broodlings (making it 3/3)",
      "better_line": "Activate Aether Spellbomb paying {U} to bounce Phyrexian Broodlings in response to the sacrifice ability, creating a 2-for-1 since the Myr token was already sacrificed as cost. Still has 3 Mountains untapped to potentially play a land and cast Goblin Researcher or Juggernaut this turn.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 77,
      "player": "MstLg Rivals",
      "decision_index": 33,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Cast Goblin Researcher before playing a land drop. Playing a land first (e.g., Island or Mountain) would give 5 mana total, leaving 1 mana open after casting Goblin Researcher. That spare mana could activate Aether Spellbomb's draw ability ({1}, sacrifice) if needed, and is strictly better sequencing.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Goblin Researcher with 4 available mana before making a land drop.",
