    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Player chose Mountain over Island when they have no blue sources on the battlefield. They have Thirst for Knowledge exiled under Goblin Researcher (requiring {2}{U}) and need blue mana to cast it. Playing Mountain provides redundant red mana with no blue cards requiring it.",
