      "decision_index": 39,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Blocked the 1/1 Myr Token with Goblin Researcher instead of the much more threatening 3/3 Phyrexian Broodlings. The opponent has 1 untapped land (Thriving Isle) and can sacrifice the Myr Token to Broodlings ({1} cost) to grow it to 4/4, making the block on the token pointless. Blocking Broodlings would force the opponent into a difficult choice: either lose the Broodlings in a trade or sacrifice the token to save it (but still taking damage and losing a creature).",
