      "description": "Attempted to activate Aether Spellbomb (likely the {U} bounce mode) without any source of blue mana among untapped lands (only Mountains and Buried Ruin available). The activation was rolled back by the game engine. The player has two Islands in hand that should be played first to enable blue mana.",
